@baseUrl = http://localhost:9377
@accessToken = {{socialLogin.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@accessToken104 = {{socialLogin104.response.body.$.data.accessToken}}
@neighborIdPending = 104
@neighborIdAccepted = 101

### 0. 소셜 로그인 (시드 user 101)
# @name socialLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-myultary-test-001",
  "email": "myultary.test@example.com",
  "name": "마이울타리테스트"
}

### 1. 다른 유저 울타리 (102) — relationStatus=ACCEPTED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/102/ultary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. 다른 유저 울타리 (104) — PENDING_RECEIVED
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/104/ultary
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3a. 내(101) 주민 목록 (RESIDENTS = 102, 103)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/101/neighbors?type=RESIDENTS&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3b. 내(101) 이웃 목록 (NEIGHBORS = 105)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/101/neighbors?type=NEIGHBORS&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. 주민 요청 (101 → 미연결 유저가 있으면) — 이미 연결된 102는 CONFLICT
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/102/neighbors/request
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5a. 대기 요청 수락 (104→101, neighborId=104) — 101이 수신자
# @name acceptPending
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/neighbors/{{neighborIdPending}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5b. (선택) 거절 테스트용 — 시드 재실행 후 reject
# POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/neighbors/{{neighborIdPending}}/reject
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. 주민 해제 (ACCEPTED 101:102) — 필요 시 시드 재실행
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/neighbors/{{neighborIdAccepted}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7a. 차단
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/102/block
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7b. 차단 해제
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/users/102/block
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 8. 요청자 측 로그인 (104) — 대기 요청 취소 테스트용
# @name socialLogin104
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/social/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "provider": "GOOGLE",
  "providerUserId": "google-seed-user-104",
  "email": "seed.u104@example.com",
  "name": "시드대기중"
}

### 8b. 요청 취소 (PENDING, 요청자만) — accept 전에 실행할 것
# DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/neighbors/{{neighborIdPending}}
# Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken104}}

### 9. 스토리 owners (101 주민 중 활성 스토리 → 103)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/main/stories/owners
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
